OL,5,G1900 Inside the Ambulance
OL,6,     FOn shift with the paramedics from
OL,7,     Fthe West Midlands Ambulance
OL,8,     FService. The team help a woman who
OL,9,     Fhas had a violent seizure and a
OL,10,     Fcarer who has crashed her bicycle.
OL,11,G2000 Inside the Operating Theatre
OL,12,     F3-year-old Isaac has an operation
OL,13,     Fon his tongue, Lynette has several
OL,14,     Ftoes straightened and David has
OL,15,     Fbiopsies taken from his prostate.
OL,16,G2100 Inside the Operating Theatre
